text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\\n{3}{U}, Exile Cobbled Lancer from your graveyard: Draw a card.', "As long as it's your turn, Sporeback Wolf gets +0/+2.", 'As long as you control another Wolf or Werewolf, Hungry Ridgewolf gets +1/+0 and has trample.', 'As long as you control seven or more enchantments, creatures you control have flying and vigilance.\\nWhenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a white Spirit Cleric creature token with "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of Spirits you control."', "As long as you've put one or more +1/+1 counters on a creature this turn, Sigardian Paladin has trample and lifelink.\\n{1}{G}{W}: Target creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it gains trample and lifelink until end of turn.", 'Ascendant Packleader enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it if you control a permanent with mana value 4 or greater.\\nWhenever you cast a spell with mana value 4 or greater, put a +1/+1 counter on Ascendant Packleader.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, choose one —\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn.\\n• Target land gains "{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}" until end of turn.\\n• Draw a card if you control a creature with power 3 or greater.\\n• You gain 3 life.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control another Wolf or Werewolf, put a +1/+1 counter on Packsong Pup.\\nWhen Packsong Pup dies, you gain life equal to its power.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control three or more creatures that each have toughness greater than their power, transform Catapult Fodder.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Then if that creature has toughness 6 or greater, transform Dormant Grove.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, target Wolf or Werewolf you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn.\\nWhenever an opponent casts their second spell each turn, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.', "At the beginning of each end step, put a slime counter on each creature you don't control.\\nCreatures you don't control get -1/-1 for each slime counter on them.\\nWhenever a creature you don't control with a slime counter on it dies, create a 1/1 black Slug creature token.\\n{U}{B}, Sacrifice a Slug: Draw a card.", 'At the beginning of your end step, create a 1/1 red Human creature token. Then if you control exactly thirteen permanents, you may sacrifice Stensia Uprising. When you do, it deals 7 damage to any target.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you discarded a card this turn, transform Ragged Recluse.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you gained life this turn, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nSacrifice two Blood tokens: Transform Restless Bloodseeker. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'At the beginning of your end step, if you gained life this turn, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{4}{B}: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'At the beginning of your end step, put an invitation counter on Wedding Announcement. If you attacked with two or more creatures this turn, draw a card. Otherwise, create a 1/1 white Human creature token. Then if Wedding Announcement has three or more invitation counters on it, transform it.', 'At the beginning of your precombat main phase, add one mana of any color.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, any opponent may sacrifice a creature. If no one does, transform Innocent Traveler.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, create a 1/1 white and black Vampire creature token with lifelink and put a bloodline counter on Edgar Markov's Coffin. Then if there are three or more bloodline counters on it, remove those counters and transform it.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, exile the top card of your library face down. You may look at that card for as long as it remains exiled.\\nOnce during each of your turns, you may play a land or cast a spell from among the cards exiled with this permanent without paying its mana cost.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may mill two cards. (You may put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.)\\nWhenever one or more creature cards are put into your graveyard from anywhere during your turn, create a 1/1 green Insect creature token. This ability triggers only once each turn.', "Blood Hypnotist can't block.\\nWhenever you sacrifice one or more Blood tokens, target creature can't block this turn. This ability triggers only once each turn.", 'Blood Petal Celebrant has first strike as long as it\'s attacking.\\nWhen Blood Petal Celebrant dies, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Bloodsworn Knight\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.\\n{1}{B}, Discard a card: Bloodsworn Knight gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Choose a number between 0 and 13. Each player sacrifices that many creatures.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n• Target Vampire you control deals damage equal to its power to another target creature.', 'Choose one —\\n• Abrade deals 3 damage to target creature.\\n• Destroy target artifact.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy target creature with flying.\\n• Destroy target enchantment.', 'Choose one —\\n• Exile target Zombie.\\n• Target opponent exiles two cards from their hand.', 'Choose one —\\n• Target creature gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)\\n• Destroy target creature with toughness 4 