(They\'re artifacts with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Menace, haste\\nWhenever Dire-Strain Anarchist attacks, it deals 2 damage to each of up to one target creature, up to one target player, and/or up to one target planeswalker.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Menace, haste\\nWhenever Volatile Arsonist attacks, it deals 1 damage to each of up to one target creature, up to one target player, and/or up to one target planeswalker.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', 'Menace\\nWhen Bloodcrazed Socialite enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever Bloodcrazed Socialite attacks, you may sacrifice a Blood token. If you do, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Menace\\nWhen Cemetery Desecrator enters the battlefield or dies, exile another card from a graveyard. When you do, choose one —\\n• Remove X counters from target permanent, where X is the mana value of the exiled card.\\n• Target creature an opponent controls gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the mana value of the exiled card.', 'Menace\\nWhen this creature transforms into Revealing Eye, target opponent reveals their hand. You may choose a nonland card from it. If you do, that player discards that card, then draws a card.', 'Menace\\nWhenever Olivia\'s Attendants deals damage, create that many Blood tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{2}{R}: Olivia\'s Attendants deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Menace\\n{2}{R}, {T}, Exile three cards from your graveyard: Create a 3/2 red Wolf creature token.', "Militia Rallier can't attack alone.\\nWhenever Militia Rallier attacks, untap target creature.", 'Nightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', "Other Vampires you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Edgar, Charmed Groom dies, return it to the battlefield transformed under its owner's control.", 'Piercing Light deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Reach, trample\\nWhen Bramble Wurm enters the battlefield, you gain 5 life.\\n{2}{G}, Exile Bramble Wurm from your graveyard: You gain 5 life.', 'Reach\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, mill a card. (Put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)\\n{2}{G}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Vilespawn Spider: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token for each creature card in your graveyard. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Reach\\nTraining (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)', 'Reclusive Taxidermist gets +3/+2 as long as there are four or more creature cards in your graveyard.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', "Rending Flame deals 5 damage to target creature or planeswalker. If that permanent is a Spirit, Rending Flame also deals 2 damage to that permanent's controller.", 'Return all land cards from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', "Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nWhen you discard Edgar's Awakening, you may pay {B}. When you do, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Return up to one target creature card and up to one target noncreature permanent card from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Retrieve.', 'Reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all land cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.', "Riphook Raider can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)", "Sacrifice two Islands: Biolume Serpent can't be blocked this turn.", 'Shattered Sanctum enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more other lands.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', 'Soulcipher Board enters the battlefield with three omen counters on it.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your graveyard.\\nWhenever a creature card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, remove an omen counter from Soulcipher Board. Then if it has no omen counters on it, transform it.', 'Stormcarved Coast enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more other lands.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Sundown Pass enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more other lands.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Target creature gains trample and gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is 1 plus the number of cards named Ancestral Anger in your graveyard.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains reach until end of turn. Untap it.', 'Target creature gets -13/-13 until end of turn. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Target creature you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn if it's night. Then it deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life. Create two Blood tokens. (They\'re artifacts with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Target player shuffles up to four target cards from their graveyard into their library. You look at the top four cards of your library, then put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', "This spell can't be countered.\\n{1}{G}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield. If it's a Wolf or Werewolf, untap Howlpack Piper. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)", 'This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Spirit. It also costs {1} less to cast if you control an enchantment.\\nCounter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', "This spell costs {1} less to cast if you control a Zombie.\\nTap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\nDraw a card.", 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if you control a Wolf or Werewolf.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', "This spell has flash as long as you control a Spirit.\\nWhen you cast this spell, tap up to two target creatures you don't control.\\nEnchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.", 'Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nWhen Parish-Blade Trainee dies, put its counters on target creature you control.', 'Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nWhen Rural Recruit enters the battlefield, create a 3/1 green Boar creature token.', "Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nWhenever Savior of Ollenbock trains, exile up to one other target creature from the battlefield or creature card from a graveyard.\\nWhen Savior of Ollenbock leaves the battlefield, put the exiled cards onto the battlefield under their owners' control.", 'Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nWhenever one or more +1/+1 counters are put on one or more Humans you control, draw a card. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, create a 1/1 green and white Human Soldier creature token with training.', 'Training (Whenever this creature attacks with another creature with greater power, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\n{2}{W}, Remove two +1/+1 counters from among creatures you control: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Trample, haste\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+1 and have trample and haste.', 'Trample, haste\\n{5}{G}{G}: Transform Ulvenwald Oddity.', "Trample\\nCultivator Colossus's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.\\nWhen Cultivator Colossus enters the battlefield, you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped. If you do, draw a card and repeat this process.", 'Trample\\nOther creatures you control get +1/+0.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Trample\\nTap two untapped creatures you control: Honeymoon Hearse becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.', "Trample\\nWhen this creature transforms into Deadly Dancer, add {R}{R}. Until end of turn, you don't lose this mana as steps and phases end.\\n{R}{R}: Deadly Dancer and another target creature each get +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Trample\\nWhenever Belligerent Guest deals combat damage to a player, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Unhallowed Phalanx enters the battlefield tapped.', 'Until end of turn, target creature becomes a blue Serpent with base power and toughness 5/5.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner\'s control with a +1/+1 counter on it."', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +3/+3, up to one other target creature gets +2/+2, and up to one other target creature gets +1/+1. Those creatures gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Vampires\' Vengeance deals 2 damage to each non-Vampire creature. Create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'Vigilance\\nOther creatures you control have vigilance.', 'Vigilance\\nSacrifice Ollenbock Escort: Target creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it gains lifelink and indestructible until end of turn.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Cemetery Prowler enters the battlefield or attacks, exile a card from a graveyard.\\nSpells you cast cost {1} less to cast for each card type they share with cards exiled with Cemetery Prowler.', 'Vigilance\\n{4}{W}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Unholy Officiant.', "Volt-Charged Berserker can't block.", 'Ward {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)\\nHamlet Vanguard enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it for each other nontoken Human you control.', "Ward {2} (Whenever this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it unless that player pays {2}.)\\n{3}{U}{U}: Dreadlight Monstrosity can't be blocked this turn. Activate only if you own a card in exile.", 'When Blood Fountain enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{3}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Blood Fountain: Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Blood Servitor enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'When Bloodtithe Harvester enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{T}, Sacrifice Bloodtithe Harvester: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is twice the number of Blood tokens you control. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'When Bramble Armor enters the battlefield, attach it to target creature you control.\\nEquipped creature gets +2/+1.\\nEquip {4} ({4}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'When Circle of Confinement enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls with mana value 3 or less until Circle of Confinement leaves the battlefield.\\nWhenever an opponent casts a Vampire spell with the same name as a card exiled with Circle of Confinement, you gain 2 life.', 'When Dominating Vampire enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature with mana value less than or equal to the number of Vampires you control until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.', 'When Doomed Dissenter dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'When Flourishing Hunter enters the battlefield, you gain life equal to the greatest toughness among other creatures you control.', 'When Gluttonous Guest enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Blood token, you gain 1 life.', 'When Lantern of the Lost enters the battlefield, exile target card from a graveyard.\\n{1}, {T}, Exile Lantern of the Lost: Exile all cards from all graveyards, then draw a card.', 'When Moldgraf Millipede enters the battlefield, mill three cards, then put a +1/+1 counter on Moldgraf Millipede for each creature card in your graveyard. (To mill a card, put the top card of your library into your graveyard.)', 'When Odric, Blood-Cursed enters the battlefield, create X Blood tokens, where X is the number of abilities from among flying, first strike, double strike, deathtouch, haste, hexproof, indestructible, lifelink, menace, reach, trample, and vigilance found among creatures you control. (Count each ability only once.)', 'When Old Rutstein enters the battlefield or at the beginning of your upkeep, mill a card. If a land card is milled this way, create a Treasure token. If a creature card is milled this way, create a 1/1 green Insect creature token. If a noncreature, nonland card is milled this way, create a Blood token.', 'When Pyre Spawn dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Resistance Squad enters the battlefield, if you control another Human, draw a card.', 'When Sanguine Statuette enters the battlefield, create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a Blood token, you may have Sanguine Statuette become a 3/3 Vampire artifact creature with haste until end of turn.', 'When Sawblade Slinger enters the battlefield, choose up to one —\\n• Destroy target artifact an opponent controls.\\n• Sawblade Slinger fights target Zombie an opponent controls.', 'When Skulking Killer enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-2 until end of turn if that opponent controls no other creatures.', 'When Spore Crawler dies, draw a card.', 'When Undead Butler enters the battlefield, mill three cards. (Put the top three cards of your library into your graveyard.)\\nWhen Undead Butler dies, you may exile it. When you do, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Voldaren Epicure enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to each opponent. Create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', "When Wedding Invitation enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Wedding Invitation: Target creature can't be blocked this turn. If it's a Vampire, it also gains lifelink until end of turn.", 'When Wretched Throng dies, you may search your library for a card named Wretched Throng, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When you attack with exactly two creatures, transform Alluring Suitor.', 'Whenever Anje, Maid of Dishonor and/or one or more other Vampires enter the battlefield under your control, create a Blood token. This ability triggers only once each turn. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\n{2}, Sacrifice another creature or a Blood token: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', "Whenever Archghoul of Thraben or another Zombie you control dies, look at the top card of your library. If it's a Zombie card, you may reveal it and put it into your hand. If you don't put the card into your hand, you may put it into your graveyard.", 'Whenever Binding Geist attacks, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.\\nDisturb {1}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)', 'Whenever Brine Comber enters the battlefield or becomes the target of an Aura spell, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.\\nDisturb {W}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)', 'Whenever Cackling Culprit or another creature you control dies, you gain 1 life.\\n{1}{B}: Cackling Culprit gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Whenever Distracting Geist attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.\\nDisturb {4}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)', 'Whenever Estwald Shieldbasher attacks, you may pay {1}. If you do, it gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'Whenever Headless Rider or another nontoken Zombie you control dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Whenever Hiveheart Shaman attacks, you may search your library for a basic land card that doesn't share a land type with a land you control, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.\\n{5}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token. Put X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Whenever Ill-Tempered Loner is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to any target.\\n{1}{R}: Ill-Tempered Loner gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', 'Whenever Infestation Expert enters the battlefield or attacks, create a 1/1 green Insect creature token.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', 'Whenever Infested Werewolf enters the battlefield or attacks, create two 1/1 green Insect creature tokens.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Whenever Mischievous Catgeist deals combat damage to a player, draw a card.\\nDisturb {2}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)', 'Whenever Odious Witch attacks, defending player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever Panicked Bystander or another creature you control dies, you gain 1 life.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if you gained 3 or more life this turn, transform Panicked Bystander.', 'Whenever Vampire Slayer deals damage to a Vampire, destroy that creature.', 'Whenever Wedding Crasher or another Wolf or Werewolf you control dies, draw a card.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Whenever Wedding Security attacks, you may sacrifice a Blood token. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Wedding Security and draw a card.', 'Whenever a Frog you control attacks, mill three cards.\\nWhenever a permanent card is put into your graveyard from your library, exile it with a croak counter on it.\\nYou may play lands and cast spells from among cards you own in exile with croak counters on them.', 'Whenever a Human you control dies, draw a card.\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, you gain 2 life.', "Whenever a nontoken Zombie enters the battlefield under your control, create a token that's a copy of that creature.", 'Whenever a permanent you control is dealt damage, Howlpack Avenger deals that much damage to any target.\\n{1}{R}: Howlpack Avenger gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, Dawnhart Disciple gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever this creature enters the battlefield or transforms into Wildsong Howler, look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Kessig Flamebreather deals 1 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Lambholt Raconteur deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, Lambholt Ravager deals 2 damage to each opponent.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, you gain 2 life.', 'Whenever you discard one or more cards, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token. This ability triggers only once each turn.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Voice of the Blessed.\\nAs long as Voice of the Blessed has four or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has flying and vigilance.\\nAs long as Voice of the Blessed has ten or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has indestructible.', 'Wrathful Jailbreaker attacks each combat if able.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', 'You draw two cards, lose 2 life, then create a Blood token. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', 'You may cast Oakshade Stalker as though it had flash if you pay {2} more to cast it.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', "You may have Mirrorhall Mimic enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it's a Spirit in addition to its other types.\\nDisturb {3}{U}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard transformed for its disturb cost.)", "Zombies you control have flying.\\n{U}, {T}, Sacrifice another nontoken creature: Create an X/X blue Zombie creature token, where X is the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '[+1]: Add {R}. Chandra, Dressed to Kill deals 1 damage to up to one target player or planeswalker.\\n[+1]: Exile the top card of your library. If it\'s red, you may cast it this turn.\\n[−7]: Exile the top five cards of your library. You may cast red spells from among them this turn. You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a red spell, this emblem deals X damage to any target, where X is the amount of mana spent to cast that spell."', '[+1]: Creatures you control gain deathtouch until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature token you control.\\n[−2]: Until end of turn, if one or more tokens would be created under your control, twice that many of those tokens are created instead.\\n[−6]: Exile all cards from all graveyards, then create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying for each card exiled this way.', '[+1]: Look at the top card of your library. You may reveal that card and put it into your hand. If you do, you lose life equal to its mana value.\\n[−2]: Create a 2/3 black Vampire creature token with flying and lifelink.\\n[−7]: Sorin the Mirthless deals 13 damage to any target. You gain 13 life.', '{1}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a token that\'s a copy of the exiled card, except it\'s a 0/0 Construct artifact in addition to its other types and it has "This creature gets +1/+1 for each Construct you control." It gains haste until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{1}{B}, Discard a card: Bloodsworn Squire gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it. Then if there are four or more creature cards in your graveyard, transform Bloodsworn Squire. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', '{1}{G}: Snarling Wolf gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{1}{R}: Lightning Wolf gains first strike until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: Target opponent loses life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness.", '{2}{B}: Return Persistent Specimen from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}{R}, {T}: Ballista Watcher deals 1 damage to any target.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', "{2}{R}: Ballista Wielder deals 1 damage to any target. A creature dealt damage this way can't block this turn.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)", '{2}{R}{G}: Create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', '{2}{U}: Exile target creature card from your graveyard and put a +1/+1 counter on Patchwork Crawler.\\nPatchwork Crawler has all activated abilities of all creature cards exiled with it.', '{3}{R}, {T}: Runebound Wolf deals damage equal to the number of Wolves and Werewolves you control to target opponent.', '{T}, Discard a creature card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Put an omen counter on Foreboding Statue.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if there are three or more omen counters on Foreboding Statue, untap it, then transform it.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\nDaybound (If a player casts no spells during their own turn, it becomes night next turn.)', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile target card from a graveyard.', '{T}: Add two mana of any one color.\\nNightbound (If a player casts at least two spells during their own turn, it becomes day next turn.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a Vampire spell.\\n{5}, {T}: Create a Blood token. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each Vampire you control. (It\'s an artifact with "{1}, {T}, Discard a card, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Draw a card, then exile a card from your hand face down. You may look at that card for as long as it remains exiled. You may pay {4}{U}{U}. If you do, transform Jacob Hauken, Inspector.', '{T}: Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn. You gain 1 life. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Voltaic Visionary deals 2 damage to you. Exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nWhen you play a card exiled with Voltaic Visionary, transform Voltaic Visionary.', "{W}, Exile three cards from your graveyard: Fleeting Spirit gains first strike until end of turn.\\nDiscard a card: Exile Fleeting Spirit. Return it to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
flavor: ['"And now I\'m coming for you!"', '"Aren\'t you going to invite me in?"', '"Aren\'t you going to offer me a drink?"', '"Blasted drake\'s interfering with the conductivity again. Garl! Go chase it away."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"Careful, this thing\'s dangerous. Wouldn\'t want anyone getting hurt."', '"Creatures of the night dissolve like shadows in the light of faith."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"Devils need no reason to stir up chaos. The chaos itself is their reward."\\n—Rem Karolus, Fiendslayer', '"Do not try to negotiate with me, human. You want power? This is the price."\\n—Ormendahl', '"Do you like it, Sister? Its dreadful visage was inspired by your own."', '"Do you mean to tell me that Lucy was bitten by such a bat . . . ?"', '"Don\'t worry everyone—I hear hoofbeats! The Gavony Riders are coming to save us!"\\n—Adin, Moorland villager', '"Even in times of brutal darkness, never mistake beauty and delicacy for weakness."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"Every day a Voldaren draws breath is a day I cannot rest."', '"Fool! Can\'t you see the tide has turned against you?"', '"Forgive my manners. It\'s been so long since I had a guest for dinner."', '"Geralf\'s prowess continues to grow. He can now replicate my own creations with near-perfect accuracy."\\n—Ludevic\'s laboratory notes', '"Ha! They fall for it every time."', '"Help! There\'s been a horrible murder!"', '"Here you go. Can\'t have you sleeping through your own wedding day."', '"Humans throw rice and release doves at their weddings? How quaint."', '"Hunter\'s fire" was meant for slaying monsters in the Ulvenwald, but that never stopped Ralen from showing it off.', '"I escaped, so why do I still feel like I\'m being watched?"\\n—Gregel, militia leader', '"I never did enjoy studying."', '"I never get any knitting done, but I don\'t entirely mind."\\n—Lorn, Lambholt innkeeper', '"I noticed you were short on party favors, so I brought my own."\\n—Higa, slayer-captain of Gatstaf', '"I refuse to die before I see the sun rise again."', '"I used to have hired hands, but I discovered they make better waitstaff with the rest of the body attached."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"I would welcome her into my pack with honor."\\n—Arlinn Kord', '"I\'ll lead."', '"If I wanted all the parts to match, I wouldn\'t have become a stitcher."\\n—Barton, stitcher', '"If you\'re not refining your tastes, what\'s the point of living forever?"', '"In case any of you new recruits were wondering, this is why we don\'t use mass graves anymore."\\n—Kerren of the Mausoleum Guards', '"Is this twisted ceremony simply a mockery of the human rite, or has Olivia fallen for her own charade?"\\n—Sorin Markov', '"It is in the hold, perhaps in one of those boxes. I\'ll unscrew them one by one and see. You work the helm."', '"It is our duty to bring the Blessed Sleep to the dead, even if they resist that gift."\\n—Grete, Order of Saint Traft', '"It won\'t bring them back, but it will bring me peace."', '"It\'s a perfect partnership. My village is safe from wolf attacks, and she gets to eat any vampires we catch."', '"It\'s not that I didn\'t expect some defiance, but I did hope it wouldn\'t be so heavily armed."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"Keep your heels down and bend at the hips as your mount takes flight. She\'ll do the rest."\\n—Anders, cathar drillmaster', '"May I have this dance?"', '"May the ocean take it"\\n—Nephalia expression meaning\\n"good riddance"', '"Me neither."', '"No, no, it\'s just a murder of crows, not an omen of murder . . . I think."\\n—York, Kessig tracker', '"Obviously it\'s dangerous, but I\'ve never seen anything like it. This could be an entirely new species! I say we follow it."\\n—Halana, Kessig ranger', '"Oh no. Oh no. Oh no. Oh no, again!"\\n—Beltstad, cathar recruit, last words', '"Oh, thank the angels. It\'s not a werewolf, just a regular wo—"\\n—Bruno, Ulvenwald guide, last words', '"Olivia Voldaren has faith only in herself. We answer to a higher calling."\\n—Thalia, Guardian of Thraben', '"Once you\'ve tasted demon blood, you\'ll wonder why you ever settled for human."', '"One vampire for every family member I\'ve lost."', '"Our bodies may lie slain, but perhaps we can still complete the ritual. I\'d rather not spend my afterlife in this wretched eternal night."', '"Our coven finds strength in nature and purpose in serving our communities."', '"Our dear Madam Mina is once more our teacher. Her eyes have been where we were blinded. Now we are on the track once again, and this time we may succeed."', '"Our kind has taken my gift for granted. It is time to correct that folly."', '"Our world may be dark, but there\'s still plenty to see."', '"Please, my friends, help yourselves to the help."\\n—Olivia Voldaren', '"Remember to come back in a few years when that fungus has died off. Then we\'ll see what\'s in the chest."\\n—Old Rutstein', '"Run! It\'s coming for us! Eventually!"\\n—Yaster, Havengul shopkeeper', '"Spend too much time scanning the shadows for evil and you\'ll never see the beauty our world has to offer."\\n—Katilda, Dawnhart Prime', '"Stand strong. We will reclaim the dawn."', '"Stay in the light. I don\'t know what lurks in those shadows, and I\'d like to keep it that way."', '"Sturdy nails make for sound sleep."\\n—Cosper Lowe of the Silbern Guard', '"Thank you, Grandmother. I love you too."', '"The blood is the life! The blood is the life!"', '"The forests of this world are unafraid to assert themselves."\\n—Wrenn', '"The jaw bone\'s connected to the skull bone. The skull bone\'s connected to the . . . uh . . . hook thingy."\\n—Garl, sticher\'s assistant', '"These seeds waited faithfully for the sun to rise again. Now, their patience is rewarded."\\n—Wrenn', '"This is your only warning, alchemist. The secrets of the sea are not yours to behold. Lord Krothuss will not be so merciful next time."\\n—Runo Stromkirk', '"This still doesn\'t make you the brains of the operation."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Thraben belongs to the living. I will not rest until it is cleansed."', '"Tread carefully. You remember what happened in the last quiet, peaceful clearing."\\n—Halana, to Alena', '"Vampires have done nothing but take from us. Tonight, we reclaim what\'s ours!"', '"We are not here to mourn their loss. We are here to celebrate their lives."\\n—Vesna, Dawnhart witch', '"We can wait like helpless children for a hero, or we can gather our courage and *be* the heroes. Who\'s with me?"', '"We cannot escape change, but with faith and fortitude, we can mold it to our liking."\\n—Marel, Dawnhart witch', '"We\'re not at odds with the woods. How could we be, when we share so many enemies?"\\n—Marel, Dawnhart witch', '"We\'ve learned enough! I say we run."\\n—Alena, Kessig trapper', '"When lost souls wander into the woods, the wilds have a way of showing them who they really are."\\n—Rahilda, Vildin-Pack alpha', '"Wipe your chin, child. We can\'t have Olivia thinking we\'re uncivilized."\\n—Anje Falkenrath', '"Works every time."\\n—Halana, Kessig ranger', '"You are one of the few to whom we offer our blessing. What fool would reject immortality?"\\n—Runo Stromkirk', '"You can always tell who\'s new from the screaming."\\n—Tinua, Skirsdag cultist', '"You can join me or feed me. Choose fast."', '"You look cold, dearie."', '"You want that venom? Collect it yourself! I\'m not losing another pair of dragonhide gloves."\\n—Old Rutstein', '"Your guard attacked me. He got what was coming to him."', '. . . "What\'s bugging you?"', '. . . but she knew it would be rude to refuse.', '. . . does not always mean living in peace.', '...knowing their hatchlings are more fearsome than anything else that might come along.', 'A carriage crafted from the finest materials. Horses bred from the finest stock. Skulls taken from the finest foes.', 'A moment of distraction, an hour off course.', 'A stitcher looks at their creation and sees the result of years of study and hours of toil. A devil sees a new plaything.', 'A tragic moment pushed him to a blasphemous act.', 'A wolf pup is always dangerous, because a wolf pup is never alone.', 'After the Travails, Runechanters set about repairing twisted symbols of Avacyn as the first step in restoring faith in the Church.', 'After weeks of unending darkness, a glimpse of dawn was all the people of Stensia needed to rekindle their will to fight.', 'All druids seek to preserve nature, but some go about it in rather unusual ways.', "And they're more than happy to share the wealth.", 'Arvon was ecstatic to offer his blood to such a captivating creature.', 'As the natural cycle of day and night grew twisted, old powers stirred deep in the Ulvenwald.', 'As the sand eroded, a faint sound could be heard whirling under the ground.', 'Before the officiant even had a chance to ask if anyone objected to the Voldaren-Markov union, Arlinn made her opinion known.', 'Between stitchers, cultists, and scavengers, corpses are in high demand.', 'By the sixth day of darkness, the lake was more blood than water.', 'Come nightfall, they were the ones fleeing in terror.', 'Created to capture the spark of genius for later use.', 'Deadly mushrooms litter these woods, each waiting for an errant footstep to release its noxious spores.', 'Even vampires know to travel faster when they hear howling in the Geier Reach passes.', 'Even when he strikes, the only sound is the snap of jaws through bone.', "Ever since the ritual, Ryla didn't have an appetite at the dinner table, but her long walks in the forest always seemed to satiate her hunger.", "Faith is a cathar's greatest weapon, but a sword of blessed silver is a close second.", 'Far from the bloodsoaked wedding, unseen by human eyes, a long-slumbering force arose to protect its home.', 'Few take kindly to being put in their place, especially if their place is the grave.', 'Frequent, violent storms shape the Nephalia coastline, sculpting cliffs and caves where monsters often lurk.', 'From the moment they arrived, wedding guests were met with a pageant of wealth and excess.', "Frozen is frozen, whether it's with cold, terror, or both.", "Geists have a knack for showing up wherever they're least expected.", 'He blends seamlessly into the forest, waiting silently for his prey.', 'He raged not just against vampires, but against civilization itself.', 'He seems absolutely imperturbable. I can fancy what a wonderful power he must have over his patients.', 'He swore to protect the Moorlands. A little thing like death was no excuse to break his oath.', 'He wanders the Moorlands hoping to one day chop off a head worthy of replacing his own.', 'Her cauldron refilled, she settled in to wait for the next unsuspecting traveler to knock at her door.', 'Her claws are another matter.', 'Her face shines with youthful innocence.', 'Her grand wedding had one goal: to unite the vampire bloodlines under her rule.', 'I knew he had left the castle now, and thought to use the opportunity to explore more than I had dared to do as yet.', 'I looked at her throat just now as she lay asleep, and the tiny wounds seem not to have healed.', 'In lieu of payment, he was granted permission to devour any unauthorized visitors.', "Innistrad's best archers are trained by the Quiver of Kessig, an order of cathars who specialize in ranged combat.", 'It can barely feel the sword anymore.', "It doesn't need to breathe, but the suit does help keep the parts together.", 'It knows one fundamental truth: bodies belong in graves.', 'Ivold was aghast when his device revealed the full scope of the geist infestation.', 'Living in harmony with nature . . .', 'Memories of the Harvesttide tragedy festered until they grew into an incarnate rage that set the world ablaze.', "Nephalia's tides obey an unforgiving moon.", 'Nothing can be more dreadful than those awful women, who were—who are—waiting to suck my blood.', "Now that it doesn't need to breathe, its hunting ground extends well beyond the sea.", "Odric resisted the vampire's curse with all his strength. But after a lifetime of fighting monsters, he was doomed to become one himself.", 'Olivia set a few villagers loose in the hedge maze as part of the evening\'s "entertainment."', 'Olivia was quick to make an example of any village that refused to pay her blood tithe.', "Once he'd tasted that dark power, there was no turning back.", 'Priests of the Sigardian Sect travel to the farthest reaches to spread hope and healing, even in the darkest times.', 'RSVP at your own risk.', 'Rather than consort with demons, the Quietus Cult seeks wisdom from the dead.', 'Riders chase the fading light recklessly through the mountains, desperate for one last glimpse of day.', 'Serpents leave their eggs in the cold and inky depths...', 'She faced down a howlpack alone, saving her town at the cost of her life.', 'She finally realized that chaos was meant to run rampant, as was she.', 'She is cursed with visions of monsters and suffering . . . and all her visions come true.', 'She monitors the roads in every province, mapping safe routes through hunting grounds and haunting grounds alike.', 'She spent many years trying to harness chaos.', 'She was ghastly, chalkily pale; the red seemed to have gone even from her lips and gums, and the bones of her face stood out prominently; her breathing was painful to see or hear.', 'Since her passing, many more travelers have made it home alive.', 'Small talk is a dying art.', 'Some geists imitate the lives they left behind. Others follow the dreams they never realized.', 'Some people take that as inspiration.', 'Some wicked souls linger only to consume the warmth of life.', 'Soothing whispers invite travelers to step closer, closer, closer . . . until they vanish soundlessly beneath the surface.', 'Specifics were kept secret, but word quickly spread that the show was a must-see.', 'Stitchers delegate the most important tasks to assistants with a good eye for detail.', 'Stitching is an ever-evolving field, with each new advancement reaching a new height of horror.', 'Swarms of bats poured from Lurenbraum Fortress carrying wedding invitations to vampires of every bloodline.', "Tamil had always wanted a closer look at a geist's lantern. Now he had an eternity to study one.", 'The Dawnhart survivors welcome recruits of all shapes and sizes.', 'The Falkenrath progenitor was a vicious falconer, and the line is quick to remind others of its heritage.', 'The Quietus Cult holds their grim ceremonies in the dark places where unburied dead litter the ground.', 'The ceremonial "incense" was a concoction of Edgar\'s own design, a precise blend of blood from his favorite human lineages.', "The door to her home survived the fires of the Malignus. Now it's her greatest weapon.", 'The local gossips swore Nesmith lost his hands in a fight with a werewolf.', 'The merchant did guarantee the new bait would bring in something big.', 'The most dangerous place to be in Kessig is alone.', "The mushrooms growing in the wolves' fur possess curative properties incredible enough to tempt many alchemists into risking their lives to track one down.", 'The recruits trained in eternal night, fueled by the hope that they might one day see the sun again.', 'The red envelopes guarantee safe passage through the Lurenbraum barrier. Olivia left strict instructions: no invitation, no entry, no exceptions.', 'The roots preserved the armor for a hundred years, safeguarding it for a traveler in need.', 'The soft creak of trees in the wind is not always cause for comfort.', "The third step in creating a skaab requires draining the body of blood and replacing it with *viscus vitae*, a mixture of angel's blood and lamp oil.", 'The towers and catwalks of the Voldaren fortress are lit by the lanterns of geists endlessly seeking a way out.', 'The villagers feared him. The cathars scorned him. Only in the wilds did he find a family that accepted him.', "The wolf's captor hid his fear, but he knew someday the runes would fail, the collar would break, and the wolf would remember his face.", "There's only so many times she can take being asked . . .", 'These days, ghouls are the only abundant resource in Thraben.', "These thick-furred wolves have adapted to Stensia's storms, channeling their energy into bursts of supernatural speed.", "They weren't entirely wrong.", 'Things buried on Innistrad rarely seem to stay that way.', "To Olivia's guests, a welcome. To everyone else, a warning.", 'To most, a terrifying apparition. To a necro-alchemist, a potent fuel source.', "Tovolar's howlpack had scattered, but the Dire-Strain survivors were still on the hunt.", "Val didn't know what the silent geist was offering . . .", 'Vampires from every bloodline mingled together, all swelling with pride to be seen at the event of the century.', "Van Helsing raised his lantern and drew the slide; by the concentrated light that fell on Lucy's face we could see that the lips were crimson with fresh blood.", 'We want no proofs; we ask none to believe us! This boy will some day know what a brave and gallant woman his mother is.', "Were it not for the cultists' fatal curiosity, the terrible machine might have lain dormant for decades more.", 'When Harold ran from the wolves, the others called him a coward.', 'When Kaya saved her village, Berit realized even vampires could be killed. When she brought one down herself, she realized she had found her calling.', 'When he could no longer carry on, he imparted his strength to the one who took up his duty.', 'When the defenses around Lurenbraum Fortress faltered, the Crimson Ballroom received some unexpected guests.', 'With Olivia distracted, Sigarda tore free from her bindings and summoned her Host of Herons.', 'Young vampires gorge themselves at every meal, but their elders have learned to savor the smallest bite.']
artist: ['Aaron J. Riley', 'Aaron Miller', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alessandra Pisano', 'Alex Brock', 'Alexander Mokhov', 'Alix Branwyn', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anato Finnstark', 'Andreas Zafiratos', 'Andrew Mar', 'Andrey Kuzinskiy', 'Anna Pavleeva', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Antonio José Manzanedo', 'April Prime', 'Artur Treffner', 'Aurore Folny', 'Ayami Kojima', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Billy Christian', 'Bram Sels', 'Brent Hollowell', 'Brian Valeza', 'Bryan Sola', 'Cabrol', 'Caio Monteiro', 'Campbell White', 'Caroline Gariba', 'Chris Cold', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christian Angel', 'Cliff Childs', 'Colin Boyer', 'Cristi Balanescu', 'DZO', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daria Khlebnikova', 'Darren Tan', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Auden Nash', 'Denman Rooke', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Dominik Mayer', 'Donato Giancola', 'E. M. Gist', 'Eelis Kyttanen', 'Ekaterina Burmak', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Wilkerson', 'Evyn Fong', 'Fajareka Setiawan', 'Fesbra', 'Filip Burburan', 'Francisco Miyara', 'G-host Lee', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ilse Gort', 'Indra Nugroho', 'Irina Nordsol', 'Iris Compiet', 'Izzy', 'Jarel Threat', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Joao Ruas', 'Jodie Muir', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'Jokubas Uogintas', 'Joshua Raphael', 'Justine Cruz', 'Justyna Dura', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karmazid', "Kasia 'Kafis' Zielińska", 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kerby Rosanes', 'Khurrum', 'Kim Sokol', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Leanna Crossan', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Lorenzo Mastroianni', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Manuel Castañón', 'Marie Magny', 'Mark Riddick', 'Marta Nael', 'Martina Fačková', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Micah Epstein', 'Mike Jordana', 'Mila Pesic', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Muhammad Firdaus', 'Nicholas Elias', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nico Delort', 'Nils Hamm', 'Néstor Ossandón Leal', 'Olena Richards', 'Olivier Bernard', 'PINDURSKI', 'Paul Jackson', 'Pauline Voss', 'Pig Hands', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Rio Krisma', 'Rovina Cai', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Sam Guay', 'Sam White', 'Sami Makkonen', 'Samuel Araya', 'Sarah Finnigan', 'Scott Murphy', 'Sean Murray', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tomas Duchek', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tuan Duong Chu', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Uriah Voth', 'Valera Lutfullina', 'Vi Szendrey (Cashile)', 'Viko Menezes', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Xiaobotong', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zara Alfonso', 'Zinna Du', 'Zoltan Boros']
